{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "dcaf61c04906e93e056ae9a3d1e6d9a7b0cb4879e1656d0246f09017a3b30898", "ja": "戦う理由", "zh": "战斗的理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "88a43002efba3c113cd6fb1255687a511b3e7ca0b35e3c36817dd264eab55876", "ja": "「必要以上に関わっちゃダメ」と言いながら\nも、未来の誘いでカフェに行く亜美。未来が\n亜美に本気を出さない理由を聞くと「理由が\nないのに戦うのはさみしい」と答える。と、\n突然ブザー音が鳴り、辺りが夜になる。", "zh": "嘴上说着“不能过度介入”，\n亚美却还是应未来的邀请去了咖啡店。未来\n问亚美为什么不认真起来时，她回答说：“没有理由\n却要战斗，会很寂寞。”就在这时，突然响起了蜂鸣声，\n四周陷入了黑夜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8a8bc323ddeea028d1194701f622e97bffe98bc58a912d8244448f7ed47a2751", "ja": "―暁陽アカデミア学都、目抜き通り―", "zh": "―晓阳学院学都，主干道―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "eb3a385f19050fffefc23c004925fbf1489962eafcb8633bfffee6fc84e79ec6", "ja": "ん～、ゆーり、ウイウイしかったな～。\nなんか青春ってカンジ！", "zh": "嗯～尤里，真是青涩啊～  \n感觉就是青春嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "48f660cce20f5b6b0b79332f27d4768d4ed8f22b1389e4630ec75c1a0fd2601b", "ja": "本当だったら亜美、止めなきゃなんだろうけど……。\nま、今回だけは見逃してあげよっと。", "zh": "按理说，亚美应该得阻止才行……  \n不过，这次就放过你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "c2eabb6a742571adf7568a65e6462d5cf2c76dda4e9740cac37fae1015f714ba", "ja": "ねえねえ亜美、今日この後ヒマ？　この近くに、\nすっごく美味しいパフェのお店ができたんだって♪", "zh": "呐呐，亚美，今天之后有空吗？听说这附近开了一家超好吃的芭菲店♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "375fea86f303ee32c5c2d6c3ecc8e2beffc49f20002c82a56a52c6e434c79bf0", "ja": "みらいっち……。だから言ってるじゃん！　亜美たち\n本当は、必要以上に関わっちゃダメなんだってば。", "zh": "未来吉……所以亚美不是早就说过了嘛！\n我们照理说，是不能有过多牵扯的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "43dec0ff5b909b3d1c12fd0b2c23cbecd1baf1e9ffdcbf1b7df09b6d17861fe6", "ja": "え～。そんなカタいこと言わないでさ～。\n今回だけは見逃してくれるんでしょ？", "zh": "诶～别说这么死板的话嘛～  \n这次你会睁一只眼闭一只眼的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "482ca417df936d7da8ac4f5d83c1cb713f74206fbcc30e20fef85dfb7db28041", "ja": "それはゆーりだけだよ。まだ新人だし、\n初回特典とか、ビギナーズラックとか、そういうヤツ。", "zh": "那只是优理才有的待遇啦。毕竟她还是新人嘛，什么首次特典啦、新手好运啦，就是那种东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "f4c05bc855627e1ab44a6fa0127393c635350b948428b096b3f811ad8497cf1e", "ja": "私だって、亜美よりは新人だよ？\nねえ、行こうよ～！", "zh": "我也算是比亚美更新的新人嘛？\n来嘛，去吧去吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "371ee12fbaba4362b55a05c4535ae5bb3d42c9e0bec3c9891ee7853b6e7bf076", "ja": "いやいやいや、みらいっちが新人はナイっしょ……\n優勝候補の一人のくせに。", "zh": "不是不是不是，未来酱怎么可能算新人啊……\n明明还是夺冠候选人之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "2372de15a38e5247cfd84dd9eb909c01d30a50eeadce93c6f5ab1e32fb3bd942", "ja": "……で？　どこなの？　そのお店って。", "zh": "……所以呢？那家店到底在哪儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "df4bb7fdd08e8a5e660891784b864ae83aaba8d605bd728cb0034c1174ae1373", "ja": "やったあ！　亜美大好き♪", "zh": "太好了！最喜欢亚美了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1012_null", "source_sha256": "f98711cb04070079f6a75522ec1c6d8f6ae32a6d8f061af2195d5a37cfd1eaa8", "ja": "ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "（人声鼎沸）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "b7cf4e007579ed4b1cf6a50bc56e14ecce1ec06a9cabda1a3edde46c60eabd0b", "ja": "むう～……悔しいけど、メチャウマ！\nさすが暁陽、スイーツもレベル高いね～。星五つ！", "zh": "唔～……虽然很不甘心，但超级好吃！\n不愧是晓阳，甜点水准也很高呢～。五星好评！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "b8ea840c85d40f6b84f4a70e183897f9b9f5ea0ac1ff711f1f3bf40b7e487a46", "ja": "ね！　来てよかったでしょ？　杏奈や百合子とも、\nそのうち一緒にこられたらいいんだけどな～。", "zh": "对吧！来这里果然没错吧？要是以后也能和杏奈、百合子她们一起过来就好了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "9f76bf74a7d52ef591d16e22eff17fc21d40dc77e966ad06cf5242bd7b644bf5", "ja": "やめときなって。亜美ならまだいいけど、\n他の風紀委員にバレたら、メッチャ怒られるよ。", "zh": "还是算了吧。要是亚美还好说，\n可要是被其他风纪委员发现了，会被骂得很惨哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "49a6d0b9807947a3a130b2110a8b4e4f07047e460f84771b71c5748bd0475b90", "ja": "大丈夫、上手くやるってば！　それより亜美、\n百合子のこと、どう思う？　あの戦具。", "zh": "没事的，我会好好弄的啦！比起这个，亚美，\n百合子那边你觉得怎么样？就是那件战具。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "32fd60d2f74625ad190e47369bd1cff88d1762dfd9e699f069277d6301978c2f", "ja": "あれはヤバヤバですな～。使い方次第で、\n上位争いに食い込めると思うよ。", "zh": "那个超不得了的呢～。我觉得只要用法得当，\n就能挤进上位圈之争哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "c9c2d6dbedfca350e0a1263bd5c368a2316fca755f7e340e33239a84522aa981", "ja": "だよね～……ま、対策は後で考えとこーっと。\nそれより亜美は、調子どう？　優勝狙わないの？", "zh": "就是嘛～……不过，对策就之后再想吧。\n话说回来，亚美你状态怎么样？不打算冲击冠军吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "bb5f4ea8c8b4ec0d4da998c6922177cd41fa92f8ddbe2a04889ca5b53fd36408", "ja": "まあ、ぼちぼちやるけど……。\nみらいっちは、いっつもやる気満々だよね。", "zh": "哎呀，就马马虎虎地搞搞呗……\n未来亲总是一副干劲满满的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "b07712aa72366f5a796667ac20d66fa803e23b1b6b890bce6263298e4951d4bd", "ja": "まーね！　私ががんばったら、暁陽のみんなのために\nなるんでしょ？　それに私、戦うの好きだし♪", "zh": "那是当然！只要我努力，就能帮到\n晓阳的大家了吧？而且我也挺喜欢战斗的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "544ffa76453bbec7c3c6f64d7a1be97de93550525dd0ef487673611ad457cb79", "ja": "だから、思いっきりやりたいんだけど……\n亜美ってば、全然本気出してないでしょ？", "zh": "所以，我想要全力以赴，可是……\n亚美她，根本就没认真吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "9901032b9f2459418e8c29b1b2211e1fc2613179f58518e63ee79cc3edcdc130", "ja": "えー？　そんなことないっぽいよ～？", "zh": "诶——？才不是那样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "f2662487c82f093203ce8ba7d0038f42c9c0da293db00d611823e24b977a3f92", "ja": "そんなことないことないっぽいよ。\n戦ってたらわかるもん。ねえねえ、なんで？", "zh": "好像也不是完全没有那回事。\n战斗的时候就能明白了嘛。呐呐，为什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "207863e6000ba570bbfbbe8f360735afe9075e86d5e8edfcb570cdf262954108", "ja": "ん～……。\nみらいっちはさ、自分がなんで戦うのかわかってる？", "zh": "嗯～……未来，你知道自己为什么要战斗吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "a33fb098a3419aed1a712f17ffa92cdc28b2b5f8b4961b3630a4db6ca43bdef5", "ja": "え？　だから、暁陽のみんなのために……。", "zh": "诶？所以说，是为了晓阳的大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "95079f58c7ecb7f8006e90cf1a5d85bfc799a93adc1fc45983378e530004d094", "ja": "そういうことじゃなくて。\nシャドウバウトが、どうして起きるのかってこと。", "zh": "不是那个意思。\n我是说，影斗为什么会发生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "62b6af9ad8f79c987de50a9ef440f41286ec78e5987e759c63be5f96590a8ac6", "ja": "誰が、いつから、何のためにやってるの？\nそもそも、陰界ってなんなの？とかさ。", "zh": "是谁、从什么时候开始、又是为了什么在做这件事？\n说到底，阴界究竟是什么？之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "b054dfc30a931b4a3029fa40ba31abe1cb77ff933e07d0dbc88505c00d25673f", "ja": "えっ？　ええと……あれっ？", "zh": "咦？呃……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "2bdef192a845b0e32893842aad67c84a24d274fdb51b6bd1096b5e95139f7bd9", "ja": "誰も知らないんだよね～、その辺のこと。\nゲームと、ルールだけ残っちゃってる。", "zh": "关于那方面的事，谁都不知道呢～。\n只剩下游戏和规则了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "3c3612fc6efb41547ec82a6dad54515b100cfb889dccb1988b65ae2df5860487", "ja": "理由がないのに戦うのって、なんかさみしいし。\nそれに、亜美の本当の仕事は、風紀を守ることだから。", "zh": "明明没有理由却要战斗，总觉得有点寂寞。\n而且，亜美真正的工作，是维护风纪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "980fe724d14f7262709890dff62e2b4dacf330ec31394b76d58e42391d9ff06e", "ja": "なんか……難しいこと考えてるんだね、亜美。\nちょっと裏切られた気分かも……。", "zh": "总觉得……你在考虑很难的事情呢，亚美。\n我好像有点被你背叛了的感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1032_011ami", "source_sha256": "976c034f4dabe7b4d2149537ce5ca3f297d418102ced1d733612310be9b54c35", "ja": "んっふっふ～、みらいっちも\nもう少し、頭を使いたまえ～。ヘッドバットとかね。", "zh": "嗯哼哼～未来亲也该再多动动脑子啦～比如用头槌什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "8be6d097d5b073ae9a0982bf74821fa38f2c82b5d3fc0164b04442f4389691e6", "ja": "ふふん、いいですよーだ。\n亜美の本気が見たいし、次は私も本気でやろうかな？", "zh": "哼哼，当然可以啦——  \n我也想看看亚美认真起来的样子，下次我也要认真来一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0394_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_03_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "0d6517c450b9396f2354a4495ce597f45efbc4c71e3e2b1dc322a43d63f7e429", "ja": "こわっ！？　本気ってまさか、おっきな方のボタン\n押す気じゃないよね？　あれはダメだよ！？", "zh": "好可怕！？你说的认真，该不会是想按那个大的按钮吧？那个可不行哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
